irit","strong":"H7307"},{"text":", and stood","strong":"H5975"},{"text":" before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", I will entice","strong":"H6601"},{"text":" him. And the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto him, Wherewith?"}]},{"id":11563,"title":"II Chronicles 18:21","segments":["And he said, I will go out, and be a lying spirit in the mouth of all his prophets. And [the LORD] said, Thou shalt entice [him], and thou shalt also prevail: go out, and do [even] so."],"ref":"II Chronicles 18:21","verse":21,"words":[{"text":"And he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", I will go out","strong":"H3318"},{"text":", and be a lying","strong":"H8267"},{"text":" spirit","strong":"H7307"},{"text":" in the mouth","strong":"H6310"},{"text":" of all his prophets","strong":"H5030"},{"text":". And [the LORD] said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Thou shalt entice","strong":"H6601"},{"text":" [him], and thou shalt also prevail","strong":"H3201"},{"text":": go out","strong":"H3318"},{"text":", and do","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" [even] so."}]},{"id":11564,"title":"II Chronicles 18:22","segments":["Now therefore, behold, the LORD hath put a lying spirit in the mouth of these thy prophets, and the LORD hath spoken evil against thee."],"ref":"II Chronicles 18:22","verse":22,"words":[{"text":"Now therefore, behold, the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" hath put","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" a lying","strong":"H8267"},{"text":" spirit","strong":"H7307"},{"text":" in the mouth","strong":"H6310"},{"text":" of these thy prophets","strong":"H5030"},{"text":", and the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" hath spoken","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" evil","strong":"H7451"},{"text":" against thee."}]},{"id":11565,"title":"II Chronicles 18:23","segments":["Then Zedekiah the son of Chenaanah came near, and smote Micaiah upon the cheek, and said, Which way went the Spirit of the LORD from me to speak unto thee?"],"ref":"II Chronicles 18:23","verse":23,"words":[{"text":"Then Zedekiah","strong":"H6667"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Chenaanah","strong":"H3668"},{"text":" came near","strong":"H5066"},{"text":", and smote","strong":"H5221"},{"text":" Micaiah","strong":"H4321"},{"text":" upon the cheek","strong":"H3895"},{"text":", and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Which","strong":"H335"},{"text":" way","strong":"H1870"},{"text":" went","strong":"H5674"},{"text":" the Spirit","strong":"H7307"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" from me to speak","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" unto thee?"}]},{"id":11566,"title":"II Chronicles 18:24","segments":["And Micaiah said, Behold, thou shalt see on that day when thou shalt go into an inner chamber to hide thyself. {into...: or, from chamber to chamber: Heb. a chamber in a chamber}"],"ref":"II Chronicles 18:24","verse":24,"words":[{"text":"And Micaiah","strong":"H4321"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Behold, thou shalt see","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" on that day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" when thou shalt go","strong":"H935"},{"text":" into an inner","strong":"H2315"},{"text":" chamber","strong":"H2315"},{"text":" to hide","strong":"H2244"},{"text":" thyself. {into...: or, from chamber to chamber: Heb. a chamber in a chamber}"}]},{"id":11567,"title":"II Chronicles 18:25","segments":["Then the king of Israel said, Take ye Micaiah, and carry him back to Amon the governor of the city, and to Joash the king's son;"],"ref":"II Chronicles 18:25","verse":25,"words":[{"text":"Then the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Take","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" ye Micaiah","strong":"H4321"},{"text":", and carry him back","strong":"H7725"},{"text":" to Amon","strong":"H526"},{"text":" the governor","strong":"H8269"},{"text":" of the city","strong":"H5892"},{"text":", and to Joash","strong":"H3101"},{"text":" the king's","strong":"H44