","strong":"H1568"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11571,"title":"II Chronicles 18:29","segments":["And the king of Israel said unto Jehoshaphat, I will disguise myself, and will go to the battle; but put thou on thy robes. So the king of Israel disguised himself; and they went to the battle."],"ref":"II Chronicles 18:29","verse":29,"words":[{"text":"And the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto Jehoshaphat","strong":"H3092"},{"text":", I will disguise","strong":"H2664"},{"text":" myself, and will go","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to the battle","strong":"H4421"},{"text":"; but put","strong":"H3847"},{"text":" thou on thy robes","strong":"H899"},{"text":". So the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" disguised","strong":"H2664"},{"text":" himself; and they went","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to the battle","strong":"H4421"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11572,"title":"II Chronicles 18:30","segments":["Now the king of Syria had commanded the captains of the chariots that [were] with him, saying, Fight ye not with small or great, save only with the king of Israel."],"ref":"II Chronicles 18:30","verse":30,"words":[{"text":"Now the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Syria","strong":"H758"},{"text":" had commanded","strong":"H6680"},{"text":" the captains","strong":"H8269"},{"text":" of the chariots","strong":"H7393"},{"text":" that [were] with him, saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Fight","strong":"H3898"},{"text":" ye not with small","strong":"H6996"},{"text":" or great","strong":"H1419"},{"text":", save only with the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11573,"title":"II Chronicles 18:31","segments":["And it came to pass, when the captains of the chariots saw Jehoshaphat, that they said, It [is] the king of Israel. Therefore they compassed about him to fight: but Jehoshaphat cried out, and the LORD helped him; and God moved them [to dep